OL,3,GNEWSALeader dined at CEO's hotel before
OL,4,A#215k hiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of a council was given
OL,7,Fdinner at a five-star "luxury" hotel
OL,8,Fshortly before the authority
OL,9,Fcontroversially appointed its owner as
OL,10,Fa #215k-a-year chief executive, the BBC
OL,11,Fhas learned.
OL,13,FReform UK's David Bick had previously
OL,14,Fsaid he had not met Dennis Bacon before
OL,15,Fhe was given the job at Norfolk County
OL,16,FCouncil after an interview which lasted
OL,17,Fjust one hour.
OL,19,FCouncil records show that Bick and
OL,20,Fanother senior councillor accepted #100
OL,21,Fof hospitality at Bacon's boutique
OL,22,Fhotel a few weeks before he was hired.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
