OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALeader dined at CEO's hotel before
OL,4,A#215k hiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FBick said he had been to the venue in
OL,7,FNorwich for a dinner with local
OL,8,Fbusinesses and could not recall meeting
OL,9,FBacon there. The BBC contacted Bacon
OL,10,Fvia the county council but it declined
OL,11,Fto say if he had been present.
